","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T16:19:32Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T16:19:32Z","body":"You have the choice of the desired driver in the settings already.\n\n<img width=\"1200\" height=\"725\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/acea70f3-b4c8-4a2d-b96b-1e964d43845a\" />\n\nAs mentioned, existing projects upgraded to 4.6 should still have `vulkan` by default there. It switches to `d3d12` if you run the Project Upgrade Tool.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800453136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800457792","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114608#issuecomment-3800457792","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114608","id":3800457792,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ihmJA","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T16:20:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T16:20:26Z","body":"> Hm.. I searched for information and I think I figured out the cause of the problem. The new NVIDIA drivers for the 20th series graphics cards have a specific bug with swap chain presentation. It causes artifacts when using `DXGI_SWAP_EFFECT_FLIP_DISCARD` and **VSync is disabled**. My assumptions are confirmed by the fact that OBS cannot record this bug. The problem occurs at the level of the final output to the screen, and not in the rendering process. Therefore, it is highly likely that this is not an engine problem, but a driver problem.\n\nDo you have a source for this?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800457792/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800461366","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114608#issuecomment-3800461366","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114608","id":3800461366,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ihnA2","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T16:21:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T16:21:10Z","body":"> It switches to d3d12 if you run the Project Upgrade Tool.\n\nMaybe the project upgrader shouldn't do that, OR call out EXPLICITLY that it's going to do that?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800461366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800492961","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114608#issuecomment-3800492961","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114608","id":3800492961,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ihuuh","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T16:27:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T16:27:18Z","body":"If you're upgrading the project, it's to be in the same conditions as new projects started in 4.6 (and you need to check the upgrade guide to know what changes, which points out the changed default rendering driver: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.6/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.6.html).\n\nBut this is all pretty off topic. There's a bug with D3D12, it should be fixed. D3D12 is the default so it should work everywhere, reverting to Vulkan is a workaround or a project-specific choice where it matters, not a recommendation to workaround an alleged driver bug.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800492961/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3801102194","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114608#issuecomment-3801102194","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114608","id":3801102194,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ikDdy","user":{"login":"Sylfa","id":4145461,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNDU0NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4145461?v=4","gravatar_id":"",